# 仓库内文本统一 LF；检出到工作区也保持 LF（Windows 编辑器均支持）。
# 避免依赖本机 core.autocrlf，消除 CRLF↔LF 假脏。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式钉死常见文本（与上行等价，给不读通配的工具/Agent 看）
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

# 显式二进制（防误当文本做换行转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.moc3 binary
*.onnx binary
*.wasm binary
*.mo binary
*.pdf binary
